---
import Logo from "@/components/Logo.astro";
import { withBase } from "@cloudflare/nimbus-docs/runtime";

const homeHref = withBase("/", import.meta.env.BASE_URL);
---

<footer class="border-t border-border bg-card">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 sm:py-16">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <a href={homeHref} class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-foreground no-underline">
          <Logo class="h-5 w-7" />
          <span class="font-mono text-base font-semibold">llms.txt 中文站</span>
        </a>
        <p class="text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground [text-wrap:pretty]">
          基于 Answer.AI 发起的 /llms.txt v2 开放标准（2026 年 8 月修订），采用 Cloudflare Nimbus 与 Bun 构建。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground">规范文档</h3>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
          <li><a href={withBase("/docs/", import.meta.env.BASE_URL)} class="no-underline hover:text-foreground transition-colors">规范总览</a></li>
          <li><a href={withBase("/docs/background-and-proposal/", import.meta.env.BASE_URL)} class="no-underline hover:text-foreground transition-colors">背景与提案</a></li>
          <li><a href={withBase("/docs/format/", import.meta.env.BASE_URL)} class="no-underline hover:text-foreground transition-colors">格式规范</a></li>
          <li><a href={withBase("/docs/changes/", import.meta.env.BASE_URL)} class="no-underline hover:text-foreground transition-colors">v2 变更记录</a></li>
          <li><a href={withBase("/docs/parser/", import.meta.env.BASE_URL)} class="no-underline hover:text-foreground transition-colors">JavaScript 解析器</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground">目录与社区</h3>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
          <li><a href="https://llmstxt.site/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="no-underline hover:text-foreground transition-colors">llmstxt.site</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://directory.llmstxt.cloud/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="no-underline hover:text-foreground transition-colors">directory.llmstxt.cloud</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://llmstxthub.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="no-underline hover:text-foreground transition-colors">llmstxthub.com</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://github.com/AnswerDotAI/llms-txt" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="no-underline hover:text-foreground transition-colors">GitHub 原仓库</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://discord.gg/aJPygMvPEN" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="no-underline hover:text-foreground transition-colors">Discord 社区频道</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground">站点资源与条款</h3>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
          <li><a href={withBase("/llms.txt", import.meta.env.BASE_URL)} class="font-mono no-underline hover:text-foreground transition-colors">/llms.txt</a></li>
          <li><a href={withBase("/llms-full.txt", import.meta.env.BASE_URL)} class="font-mono no-underline hover:text-foreground transition-colors">/llms-full.txt</a></li>
          <li><a href={withBase("/index.md", import.meta.env.BASE_URL)} class="font-mono no-underline hover:text-foreground transition-colors">/index.md</a></li>
          <li><a href={withBase("/privacy/", import.meta.env.BASE_URL)} class="no-underline hover:text-foreground transition-colors">隐私政策</a></li>
          <li><a href={withBase("/terms/", import.meta.env.BASE_URL)} class="no-underline hover:text-foreground transition-colors">使用条款</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 flex flex-col gap-2 border-t border-border pt-6 text-xs text-muted-foreground sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
      <p>规范原作者：Jeremy Howard（Answer.AI） · 本站为社区中文落地页与文档站</p>
      <p class="font-mono">Nimbus + Bun · 遵循 /llms.txt v2 规范</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
